"Mindsw33per" <chaosmos@gmx.net> wrote:
> How could one use tiles in the PocketPC version of nethack? the normal 
> usage by writing "tiles=XYZFile.bmp" doesnt work.

Works OK for me. The relevant portion of my defaults.nh says:

OPTIONS=tile_file:\SD-MMCard\_Usb\NetHack\tiles20x10c.bmp,tile_height:20,tile_width:10
OPTIONS=map_mode:tiles,scroll_margin:20

I'm using my favourite tileset, geoduck, from here:
http://www.olywa.net/cook/nhack.htm

but if I replace the above two OPTIONS lines with:

OPTIONS=map_mode:tiles

then I get the vanilla tileset that's built in to NetHack.

Once within the game, you can select tiles or ASCII through the Map menu.

